@title Ctrl+K "live view" leads to the Live view; a lesson says where the replaced project went
@area Palette
# C-45: the command comes first, and opening a lesson over a project tells you the work is kept.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text live view
wait 6
shot live-view-search
check_layout
key Escape
wait 4
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text add page
wait 6
key Enter
wait 6
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text the live view
wait 6
key Down
key Enter
wait 3
shot lesson-opened
check_layout
